  "description": "A Software Reflexion Model for .NET: declare the architecture you believe you have, and find out where the code disagrees. Reflexion reads assembly metadata with System.Reflection.Metadata — nothing under analysis is ever loaded or executed — maps IL entities onto the modules you declared, and reports convergences, divergences and absences.\n\nThis is a reserved name. Version 0.0.1-alpha is an empty placeholder with no usable code; it exists so the package identity is settled while the library is designed. Do not take a dependency on it yet.",
